{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1110912-help-in-understanding-fallen-from-the-timbers-catch","id":1110912,"title":"help in understanding Fallen From the Timbers Catch","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-07-03T10:30:08-07:00","id":1110912,"title":"help in understanding Fallen From the Timbers Catch","content":"<span style=\"color:#212121\"><span style=\"font-family:wf_segoe-ui_normal\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Hi everyone.</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#212121\"><span style=\"font-family:wf_segoe-ui_normal\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">I and my group of friends are playing a campaign of changeling: the lost but we can't get the meaning of a catch, so we tought to ask our question here on the forum</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#212121\"><span style=\"font-family:wf_segoe-ui_normal\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">The catch in question is the eternal winter :&quot;Fallen from the timbers&quot;</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#212121\"><span style=\"font-family:wf_segoe-ui_normal\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">That says &quot;The Contract's target wears silver jewelry that has religious meaning for her.&quot;</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#212121\"><span style=\"font-family:wf_segoe-ui_normal\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Now we were wondering if it's the changeling to wear the silver jewellery or the one the changeling want to strike.</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#212121\"><span style=\"font-family:wf_segoe-ui_normal\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">We noticed that most of the time in the manual when referring to the changeling is used &quot;she&quot;,also on the white wolf wiki says:&quot;If wearing silver religious jewelry, the changeling can create a dangerously cold blast of ice.&quot; That give credit to the theory wich is the changeling that has to wear it, but we also know that the wiki is not official and anyone could edit it. </span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#212121\"><span style=\"font-family:wf_segoe-ui_normal\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Can you help us to solve this little doubt of ours?</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#212121\"><span style=\"font-family:wf_segoe-ui_normal\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Thanks in advance</span></span></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13617-xenon472","name":"Xenon472","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-05T10:08:06-07:00","id":1111694,"title":"","content":"I would interpret that to mean that the target is the one wearing the jewelry, but I'd go with whatever works best for your game.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Jason Ross Inczauskis</b>, Freelance Writer<br /> Projects: <i>Dark Eras 2</i>, <i>Mummy: The Curse 2e, Book of Lasting Death, DtR The Clades Companion, Pirates of Pugmire,</i> <i>They Came From Beyond the Grave!, </i><i>TC Aeon: Mission Statements</i>, <i>TC In Media Res,</i> <i>DtD Night Horrors: Enemy Action,</i> <i>C20 Anthology of Dreams</i><br /> Masculine pronouns preferred.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/309-white-oak-dragon","name":"White Oak Dragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar309_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"941"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-05T11:42:53-07:00","id":1111748,"title":"","content":"I would also rule that it's the victim that should wear the jewelry, since it's the target.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12295-lokiel","name":"Lokiel","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"37"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}